<title>INDIA: Indian June industrial production up 6.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian June industrial production up 6.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 6.8 percent in June over the same month in 1995, the government said on Monday.  </p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Jun 96    May 96     Jun 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +6.8     +10.6	+12.2</p>
<p>     -Mining			 +2.0	+2.6	+17.4</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		+9.1     +13.2	+11.1</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  -1.7	+3.5	+14.6</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  280.0     289.2	262.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures for June 1996 are preliminary. Figures for May 1996 have been revised.</p>
</text>
